  "subject": "a woman who buys her boyfriend a loud brass twin-bell wind-up alarm clock from a Sham Shui Po second-hand shop because he never wakes on time, and every night before she goes home she winds it exactly twelve turns at his bedside, until one night he winds it for her",
  "caption": "Cantonese yé-yé girl-pop, 1960s Hong Kong a-go-go revival. Twangy baritone electric guitar riff, bouncy melodic electric bass, Farfisa-style combo organ chords, tambourine on every backbeat with snappy drums. Warm tape recording, light plate reverb. Female soprano, sweet and bright, clearly sung melody. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 132 BPM, G major. Sunny teasing love song with a swinging step. No trap drums, no autotune, no rap, no modern EDM synths, no power-ballad drums.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n深水埗舊鋪頭\n我揀咗個銅鬧鐘\n兩粒鐘頂好大聲\n專登買嚟對付你\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n你成日遲到\n今晚等我嚟\n\n[Chorus]\n我幫你上鏈\n一圈 兩圈 十二圈\n聽住佢滴滴答答\n聽朝準時起身\n\n[Verse]\n你話佢嘈到死\n響到隔籬都醒\n我話嘈先叫得醒\n你呢隻大懶豬\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n你攬住個枕頭\n扮聽唔到我講\n\n[Chorus]\n我幫你上鏈\n一圈 兩圈 十二圈\n你笑住拉我隻手\n叫我唔好咁快走\n\n[Verse]\n今晚我要返屋企\n攞起手袋落樓\n你突然叫住我\n手入面揸住鬧鐘\n\n[Bridge]\n你話今次輪到你\n幫我上返十二圈\n等我聽朝都記得你\n\n[Chorus]\n你幫我上鏈\n一圈 兩圈 十二圈\n叮叮噹噹響出嚟\n原來係叫我嫁你\n\n[Chorus]\n我幫你上鏈\n一圈 兩圈 十二圈\n聽住佢滴滴答答\n聽朝準時起身\n\n[Outro]\n一圈 兩圈 十二圈\n聽朝見",
